    a fork of https://github.com/kisonecat/tikzjax by Jim Fowler, maintained by
    Glenn Rice for WeBWorK.
    Built on kisonecat/web2js, jhoobergs/web2js, drgrice1/web2js and
    drgrice1/dvi2html.
    License: the package metadata declares GPL-3.0 or later; the project it
    forks (kisonecat/tikzjax) is distributed under the LPPL 1.3c.  Neither
    repository ships a license text file, so both facts are recorded in
    vendor/tikzjax/LICENSE.txt together with the upstream license text.

    The bundled TeX system files (vendor/tikzjax/tex_files/) come from TeX Live
    and are covered by their own licenses: PGF/TikZ is dual licensed under the
    GNU GPL v2+ and the LaTeX Project Public License 1.3c; the LaTeX base and
